{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12225150","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1222515001:0":{"text":"보르스에게 너희가 게스트 하우스에서 묵고 있었다고 들었는데, 정말이었네.","source_cn":"波尔斯说你们来住店了。果然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4601777855F757E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222515002:0":{"text":"이봐, 일어나! 정신 좀 차려!","source_cn":"喂，醒醒！清醒点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50C681C81B953D3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222515003:0":{"text":"음, 신... 신밧드...?","source_cn":"唔，辛、辛巴达……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFDDF8516B49860C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222515004:0":{"text":"후...암... 피곤해...","source_cn":"呼……啊，好累……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7FD9BFBB5412E5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222515005:1":{"text":"아침부터 무슨 일이에요... 설마 어제 또 못 잤어요? 진정 포션이 효과가 없었나...","source_cn":"怎么大早上找过来……你晚上又没睡好？安神药剂没用吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2530635AA21CC1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222515006:1":{"text":"효과는 있었어, 물론 아주 조금이지만. 누우니까 바로 잠들었거든, 그렇게 빨리 잠든 적은 처음이야.","source_cn":"有用，但只有一点用。我一躺下就睡着了，从没有那么快过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8BE74A247AAEBB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222515007:1":{"text":"하지만 꿈은 여전히 또 꾸긴 했어. 이전과 똑같은 꿈이었는데... 이번엔 정말 선명했지...","source_cn":"但我还是做梦了，和之前一样的梦！只不过这次不一样，那个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CF725D542875E9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1222515007":{"text":"하지만 꿈은 여전히 또 꾸긴 했어. 이전과 똑같은 꿈이었는데... 이번엔 정말 선명했지...","source_cn":"但我还是做梦了，和之前一样的梦！只不过这次不一样，那个梦非常清晰——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CF725D542875E9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222515009:0":{"text":"치피... 치피도 기억났어요! 누군가 꿈에 와서 시끄럽게 떠들었어요!","source_cn":"满满……满满想起来了！好像也有人在我的梦里叽叽喳喳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A091BD854F1010","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222515010:1":{"text":"해미도요! ","source_cn":"我也是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00E75ABFC6921997","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222515011:1":{"tex